----------------------- GRAPHQL CALL FLOW --------------------------------------

React Component (ContactList.tsx)
       │
       ▼ sends query via Apollo
react/graphql/GetContacts.gql
       │
       ▼ network request to /_v/graphql
graphql/schema.graphql
       │
       ▼ routes request to
node/resolvers/contacts.ts
       │
       ▼ fetches documents from
VTEX Master Data (Entity 'CF')



----------------------- API CALL FLOW --------------------------------------

React Component (ContactListApi.tsx)
       │
       ▼ triggers HTTP GET via fetch()
`/_v/custom/contact-us?page=1&pageSize=10`
       │
       ▼ matches path rule defined in
node/service.json
       │
       ▼ executes route handler in
node/index.ts (`routes.getContactUs`)
       │
       ▼ runs Koa middleware
node/middlewares/getContactUs.ts (reads ctx.query, sets ctx.body)
       │
       ▼ calls custom client method
node/clients/masterdata.ts (`getPaginatedData`)
       │
       ▼ fetches documents from
VTEX Master Data (Entity 'CF')